1
00:00:00,871 --> 00:00:02,791
- Brent Spiner?
- Yes.

2
00:00:03,958 --> 00:00:05,748
(Sheldon:)I don't care.

3
00:00:07,378 --> 00:00:11,428
(Leonard:)Really? Brent Spiner,
Mr. Data himseIf. You love him.

4
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:16,050
(Sheldon:)I did, but I think
I've kind of outgrown Star Trek.

5
00:00:18,222 --> 00:00:22,772
(Sheldon:)You know, stock characters,
Iudicrous plots, beam me up.

6
00:00:22,935 --> 00:00:25,025
(Sheldon:)What a load of hooey.

7
00:00:25,855 --> 00:00:28,485
(Howard:)I'm going.
Live long and prosper, Sheldon.

8
00:00:28,649 --> 00:00:31,109
(Sheldon:)Yeah, even that. You look like a dork.

9
00:00:33,863 --> 00:00:37,453
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Howard, Bernadette's here!

10
00:00:37,616 --> 00:00:39,116
(Howard:)Tell her I'm not home!

11
00:00:39,285 --> 00:00:42,375
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)What kind of a schmuck
play is that? She can hear you shouting!

12
00:00:46,083 --> 00:00:49,713
- Can we talk?
- You can. I have nothing to say.

13
00:00:51,005 --> 00:00:52,885
(Wil:)All right.

14
00:00:53,299 --> 00:00:56,969
(Bernadette:)I just wanted to tell you I'm sorry
I said something to your mother.

15
00:00:57,136 --> 00:01:00,806
(Howard:)I was gonna tell her eventually
but you went behind my back.

